      "content": "thanks for those, they're much better for the artists. i missed the last bit of the officer one too, can u finish that and then give me some more detailed physical/ethnic breakdowns for all four characters? \n\ni need the artist to have a clear idea of the race/ethnicity for each one so they don't all end up looking the same. i want a good mix for the world. \n\nso can u give me full physical/ethnic descriptions for:\n- the tech ceo (evelyn)\n- the suspicious person (shadow)\n- the friendly neighbor (marcy)\n- the high-ranking police officer\n\njust one or two sentences per person like before is fine, just needs the race/ethnicity and some physical details included. thx!",
